OL,3,AHundreds more prisoners being freed in
OL,4,Asecond phase of early release scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbout 650 more offenders are leaving
OL,7,Fjails in England and Wales on Tuesday,
OL,8,Fin the second phase of the early
OL,9,Frelease scheme - the government's plan
OL,10,Fto tackle the prison population crisis.
OL,12,FIt includes offenders sentenced to up
OL,13,Fto two and a half years who are leaving
OL,14,Fjail after serving a third of their
OL,15,Fsentence behind bars, rather than half.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,0,100
